## 10. Perform Multiple Aggregations at Once

Used `$facet` to calculate total students and average CGPA simultaneously.

```javascript
db.studentsAgg.aggregate([
    {
        $facet: {
            totalStudents: [
                {
                    $count: "count"
                }
            ],
            averageCGPA: [
                {
                    $group: {
                        _id: null,
                        average: {
                            $avg: "$cgpa"
                        }
                    }
                }
            ]
        }
    }
])
```

### Output

```text
[
  {
    totalStudents: [
      { count: 10 }
    ],
    averageCGPA: [
      { _id: null, average: 8.51 }
    ]
  }
]
```

