## 12. Join with Another Collection

Used `$lookup` to join `studentsAgg` with `studentResults` using `studentId`.

```javascript
db.studentsAgg.aggregate([
    {
        $lookup: {
            from: "studentResults",
            localField: "studentId",
            foreignField: "studentId",
            as: "resultDetails"
